 "caption": "WHO WON THE OG TRADE? 🦖🗽\n\nThree years later, here's the scoreboard:\n• Knicks got: OG Anunoby. Two deep playoff runs, then a ring in 2026, the Knicks' first title since 1973\n• We got: RJ Barrett, Immanuel Quickley and the pick that became Jonathan Mogbo (No. 31, 2024)\n• Years one and two: we missed the playoffs (RJ still put up 21.1 PPG in 2024-25)\n• Then we went out in round one in 2026, and Mogbo signed with Sacramento in July\n\nAdd it up: OG for RJ, IQ and a pick. We're 5-10 with RJ scoring 20.9 a night. The Knicks are 9-6, and OG beat us twice this week.\n\nStill, a ring is a ring. Tonight we're at Detroit, 7:30 PM ET. Win and we're 6-10.\n\nSo who won the OG trade: Knicks or Raptors? You make the call 👇",
